{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37767","headline":"敷溪高士 · 郑谷","name":"敷溪高士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敷溪南岸掩柴荆，挂却朝衣爱净名。\n闲得林园栽树法，喜闻儿侄读书声。\n眠窗日暖添幽梦，步野风清散酒酲。\n谪去徵还何扰扰，片云相伴看衰荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}